六","author":"区大相","text":"闲来梅树下，爱此岁寒花。\n何处堪留赏，瑶台即我家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22795,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同四兄咏梅寄七弟 其七","author":"区大相","text":"月向枝上照，风从花下绕。\n风月如有情，憔悴令人老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22796,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同四兄咏梅寄七弟 其八","author":"区大相","text":"本来江岭侧，发艳玉台层。\n孤芳但自保，何畏雪霜淩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22797,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同四兄咏梅寄七弟 其九","author":"区大相","text":"莫谓移根远，开芳入汉宫。\n一枝何未放，知是待春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22798,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同四兄咏梅寄七弟 其十","author":"区大相","text":"常日看花兴，兄行弟必陪。\n今朝望乡国，携手上春台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22799,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"岘亭再作","author":"区大相","text":"独携千古意，偶向林间坐。\n由来岘首碑，此泪非空堕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22800,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樊城乐 其一","author":"区大相","text":"樊城多估客，赀富者称强。\n明珠买歌笑，识是广州商。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22801,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樊城乐 其二","author":"区大相","text":"闻君五湖去，三载无信息。\n但能念旧谊，何虑不相忆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22802,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樊城乐 其三","author":"区大相","text":"夙昔逢欢时，想见何草草。\n女萝附槿花，如何得终老。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22803,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"樊城乐 其四","author":"区大相","text":"结伴三江口，游戏五湖中。\n不惜今憔悴，当念旧时容。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22804,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈勋卿滘口西庄杂咏 其一","author":"区大相","text":"柴门临滘口，重叠见溪山。\n更著一茅宇，分明图画间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22805,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈勋卿滘口西庄杂咏 其二","author":"区大相","text":"衔杯何处好，风月临江美。\n为问江上翁，赏心竟谁是。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22806,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈勋卿滘口西庄杂咏 其三","author":"区大相","text":"门临绿野尽，鸟下清江深。\n借问王孙意，宁知春草心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22807,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈勋卿滘口西庄杂咏 其四","author":"区大相","text":"前山多白云，可望不可即。\n惆怅山中人，遥遥似相识。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22808,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陈勋卿滘口西庄杂咏 其五","author":"区大相","text":"归耕亦何事，十亩江边云。\n独与饮牛客，门前水竹分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22809,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王光禄园林杂咏 其一","author":"区大相","text":"洞小沿花入，花香出洞新。\n彩云飞不去，留作洞中春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22810,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王光禄园林杂咏 其二","author":"区大相","text":"山楼积翠多，纷纷皆可挹。\n不知翠入楼，但觉琴书湿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22811,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王光禄园林杂咏 其三","author":"区大相","text":"与子共垂钓，白日照孤舫。\n春来云水生，清风动兰桨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22812,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"王光禄园林杂咏 其四","author":"区大相","text":"小艇日无事，回塘逗夕曛。\n幸无风浪险，随意宿溪云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22813,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其一","author":"区大相","text":"生平丘壑意，到此即情畅。\n花鸟入新年，欣欣巳相向。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22814,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其二","author":"区大相","text":"拂拂复摇摇，春色向人骄。\n谁知入林客，神理固自超。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22815,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其三","author":"区大相","text":"青春对华馆，少饮亦陶然。\n起步绿芜上，行吟芳草边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22816,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其四","author":"区大相","text":"新年诗酒兴，携赏入山池。\n一步一留眄，高谈恣所之。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22817,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其五","author":"区大相","text":"步步山情适，烟霞春望高。\n庭梅飘未尽，半巳落源桃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22818,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"正月十五日霍君仪邀游朱季美山池同用畅超然之高情为韵 其六","author":"区大相","text":"灯烂花仍艳，弦娇酒复清。\n共将行乐意，来此叙幽情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22819,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日访山家","author":"区大相","text":"苔径无尘到渐赊，小园留客剪春茶。\n自从闭却山门路，落尽山樱几树花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22820,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江杨柳词赠别 其一","author":"区大相","text":"客与春江江可怜，柳条拂水又含烟。\n绿波一道金堤合，何处津楼系酒船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22821,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春江杨柳词赠别 其二","author":"区大相","text":"江岸溪桥绿似匀，一枝烟里送行新。\n正堪对酒听黄鸟，无那当春别故人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22822,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏和怨歌","author":"区大相","text":"梦时欢爱醒时空，江水郎情日向东。\n桃叶纵轻那得渡，柳丝不定却因风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22823,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下逢故人","author":"区大相","text":"花里逢君倒玉卮，情多未语又伤离。\n檐前碧柳如相怨，绾尽长条知为谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22824,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梁少仲夜过濠上","author":"区大相","text":"云木萧疏覆短垣，焚香习静了无言。\n寻常竹下经过少，惟许幽人夜叩门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22825,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"听豫章贞吉王孙吹铁笛","author":"区大相","text":"裂石穿云歇又闻，铁龙高响入层云。\n临池不用徵丝竹，吹散匡庐万叠氛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22826,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京风霾连日春昼阴冥不得跨蹇驴出郭怅然有作 其一","author":"区大相","text":"旅馆莺花病客身，出门何处叩枫宸。\n阴霾十日连城阙，二月燕山不见春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22827,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京风霾连日春昼阴冥不得跨蹇驴出郭怅然有作 其二","author":"区大相","text":"燕京十日天雨沙，客子春来只忆家。\n纵使素缁元不化，那能长负武陵花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22828,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕京风霾连日春昼阴冥不得跨蹇驴出郭怅然有作 其三","author":"区大相","text":"天色冥冥碣石昏，风尘终日混乾坤。\n蹇骑何处看花去，拂几焚香深闭门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22829,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城马首望西山 其一","author":"区大相","text":"出城一里已村寺，况有山翠堕马前。\n殿阁连空半烟雾，清凉何处是西天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22830,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城马首望西山 其二","author":"区大相","text":"西来绀宇郁重重，金地炉香隐碧峰。\n驰道绿杨三十里，夕阳应扣下山钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22831,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城马首望西山 其三","author":"区大相","text":"芳郊草色欲浮空，处处垂杨隐梵宫。\n信马独行随所适，帝城春在雨花中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22832,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"出城马首望西山 其四","author":"区大相","text":"天花万树宝宫来，云际千峰向水开。\n闻道湖村佳景色，断烟疏柳出楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22833,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿碧云寺","author":"区大相","text":"寂寂松坛结暝烟，泠泠石上听流泉。\n十年京国红尘梦，留得山窗一榻眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22834,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀讯友人 其一","author":"区大相","text":"燕阳为客几经春，鲁国朱家是故人。\n今日汉宫谁荐士，世情一见一回新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22835,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀讯友人 其二","author":"区大相","text":"卞生怀璧一何冤，桃李成蹊在不言。\n为问归齐越石父，今朝谁是左骖恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22836,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀讯友人 其三","author":"区大相","text":"自闭藤萝阅古方，茂陵归卧著书长。\n昔时意气今谁在，独抱清羸付药王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22837,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吴姬吟","author":"区大相","text":"金塘霜落渚莲稀，日暮吴姬荡桨归。\n白纻风前吹不散，夜随明月过江飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22838,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江南归思","author":"区大相","text":"千里蒹葭抹夕岚，几群鸿雁度澄潭。\n砧声忽送关山月，一夜归心向岭南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22839,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜鹃花","author":"区大相","text":"似鸟为花唤未真，千声啼血染成春。\n曾向六宫惊梦醒，至今愁杀浣花人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22840,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中蔷薇","author":"区大相","text":"短刺长条满院香，淡烟微雨洗红妆。\n织成锦字凭谁寄，起向阑干玉箸长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22841,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"区大相","text":"卯酒初销羯鼓新，沉香亭榭已成尘。\n何如夜半烧银烛，别照巴川锦段春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22842,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春塘曲","author":"区大相","text":"夭桃秾李间垂杨，青鬓朱唇杂粉光。\n歌罢采芳人不见，落花无数点回塘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22843,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新秋沧溪月下泛舟","author":"区大相","text":"满林新月水微波，画楫乘流入兴多。\n一片银河秋色浅，相看脉脉奈愁何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22844,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谭永明游江东 其一","author":"区大相","text":"尊酒离愁惨不挥，平沙立望断蓬飞。\n当年游侠倾燕市，老向江东作布衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22845,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送谭永明游江东 其二","author":"区大相","text":"铁骑曾驱紫塞秋，长城新月照刀头。\n将军不用平胡策，落日萧条吴楚游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22846,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪知事赴闽幕 其一","author":"区大相","text":"薄宦驱驰越海湄，简书又向七闽移。\n莺花三月连南国，伴逐宫舟过武夷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22847,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠汪知事赴闽幕 其二","author":"区大相","text":"春树迢迢隔海云，无诸城向海门分。\n花前忽送迁莺去，何处听莺又送君。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22848,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭金吾还朝 其一","author":"区大相","text":"家住层城接御沟，承恩使越锦衣游。\n尺书入报明光殿，东尽扶桑看海流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22849,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠谭金吾还朝 其二","author":"区大相","text":"年少才多好丈夫，朝回新拜执金吾。\n南过铜柱元标汉，西出榆关更射胡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22850,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"院鹤吟 其一","author":"区大相","text":"连翩玉羽下瑶台，玉堂主人携放来。\n松际长鸣花外立，月明仙驭凤池回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22851,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"院鹤吟 其二","author":"区大相","text":"绕砌巡池止复行，孰知心迹与双清。\n有时露白秋林净，一片仙姿月下鸣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22852,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"院鹤吟 其三","author":"区大相","text":"朱顶玄裳白雪衣，松庭竹院立斜晖。\n情知不是轩墀物，养就翀天翼便飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22853,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏上苑桃花 其一","author":"区大相","text":"御沟流出是仙源，二月风光满帝园。\n为见开花向瑶水，始知方朔在金门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22854,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏上苑桃花 其二","author":"区大相","text":"临水丛花帝苑新，虽成蹊径不成津。\n玉盘未献千年实，露井先开万岁春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":22855,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]